        "text": "<thinking> To encrypt a plaintext payload with a managed key, I will use the AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the external provider. This service allows for the creation and management of cryptographic keys and the protection of data using these keys. The provider will be identifiable in the code by importing the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and by using the AWS KMS client to perform the encryption operation. </thinking>\n",
